[en.FOCUS_C12_ROAD_OF_APPLELOOSA]
Road Apart

[en.FOCUS_C12_ROAD_OF_APPLELOOSA_desc]
Since the family meeting and the buffalo incident, relations between the two families have become increasingly strained. If these divisions continue, they may never unite to overcome the Empire. Will Limestone Pie stand by and watch the Apple Pie Alliance fall apart?

[zh.FOCUS_C12_ROAD_OF_APPLELOOSA]
渐行渐远

[zh.FOCUS_C12_ROAD_OF_APPLELOOSA_desc]
自从家族会议和野牛事件后，两个家族之间的关系变得愈发紧张。如果继续分歧下去，就再也无法团结起来战胜帝国，石青派会眼睁睁的看着苹果派联盟分崩离析吗？

